## 🧭 Who We Are

**AwayDDos** is a global DDoS protection and traffic scrubbing provider with one goal: *Keep DDoS Away. Keep Online Always.* Distributed scrubbing nodes and a proprietary **two-layer cleaning architecture** divert and dilute flood traffic near the attack source, then apply deep packet and behavioral filtering at scrubbing centers — only verified, clean traffic ever reaches your origin.

- Website: <https://awayddos.com>
- Services: **DDoS protection, high-defense IP, traffic scrubbing, gaming shield, finance / e-commerce / API / IDC solutions, WAF**
- Industries served: Gaming / Streaming, Finance / Exchange, E-commerce / Cross-border retail, API / SaaS, IDC / Data center
- Languages: English / 中文

