---

## 💡 Why AwayDDos

- **Two-Layer Cleaning Architecture** — Near-source scrubbing dilutes Tbps-scale floods close to the attacker; deep cleaning at scrubbing centers precisely blocks SYN floods, CC, UDP reflection and more. Attacks never reach your origin.
- **Fixed Pricing · Attack-Proof Costs** — Transparent plan pricing that never surges mid-attack, and never "blackholes" your business if you don't pay.
- **Intelligent Global Routing** — Real-time shortest-path scheduling steers attack traffic to the nearest scrubbing node while clean traffic returns via the optimal route. Fast, stable, clean.
- **Expert Security Team** — Seasoned network-security experts on duty 7×24, from onboarding and incident response to continuous intelligent tuning.
- **Minutes to Onboard** — Just point your DNS at the protection nodes; protection takes effect in minutes with no architecture changes.

