## 📊 Results (illustrative)

- 🎮 **New game launch under botnet siege** — **8.6 Tbps** peak attack scrubbed, **0** origin downtime, seamless player experience.
- 🏦 **Exchange Open API hit by CC & slow attacks** — **99.9%** malicious requests blocked, **−40%** API latency.
- 🛒 **Flash-sale mixed attack** — **0** blackhole, **0** attack surcharge, record sales revenue.
- 🔌 **B2B API abused by botnets** — **97%** abnormal traffic cut, **100%** legitimate reachability.

